{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-class-diagram",
  "category": "diagrams",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-class-diagram&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-class-diagram",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": [
        "Diagrama de clases UML en SVG, sin Mermaid. Tú declaras clases y",
        "          relaciones; el componente decide las capas, dibuja los tres",
        "          compartimentos clásicos (nombre, atributos, métodos) y rutea las",
        "          relaciones rodeando las cajas."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          Comparte motor con <code>&lt;iswc-flowchart&gt;</code>: mismo esquema",
            "          JSON, mismo visor a pantalla completa y la misma animación tortuga,",
            "          que aquí recorre las relaciones en orden.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-class-diagram open-on-click>",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "              {",
            "                \"classDiagram\": {",
            "                  \"title\": \"Dominio de facturación\",",
            "                  \"direction\": \"TB\",",
            "                  \"groups\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g-dominio\", \"name\": \"Dominio\", \"hue\": 239 },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g-terceros\", \"name\": \"Terceros\", \"hue\": 199 }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"classes\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"Factura\", \"name\": \"Factura\", \"stereotype\": \"<<entity>>\", \"group\": \"g-dominio\",",
            "                      \"attributes\": [\"+numero: string\", \"-total: number\", \"-fecha: date\", \"-cufe: string\"],",
            "                      \"methods\": [\"+anular(): void\", \"+totalizar(): number\"] },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"Item\", \"name\": \"ItemFactura\", \"group\": \"g-dominio\",",
            "                      \"attributes\": [\"+cantidad: number\", \"-precio: number\"],",
            "                      \"methods\": [\"+subtotal(): number\"] },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"Pago\", \"name\": \"Pago\", \"group\": \"g-dominio\",",
            "                      \"attributes\": [\"-valor: number\"],",
            "                      \"methods\": [\"+registrar(): void\"] },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"Cliente\", \"name\": \"Cliente\", \"stereotype\": \"<<entity>>\", \"group\": \"g-terceros\",",
            "                      \"attributes\": [\"+nit: string\", \"+razonSocial: string\"] },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"Tercero\", \"name\": \"Tercero\", \"group\": \"g-terceros\",",
            "                      \"attributes\": [\"#id: string\"] }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"relations\": [",
            "                    { \"from\": \"Factura\", \"to\": \"Item\", \"kind\": \"composition\", \"label\": \"1..*\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"Factura\", \"to\": \"Cliente\", \"kind\": \"association\", \"label\": \"1\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"Factura\", \"to\": \"Pago\", \"kind\": \"dependency\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"Cliente\", \"to\": \"Tercero\", \"kind\": \"inheritance\" }",
            "                  ]",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-class-diagram>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:open-on-click",
              "label": "open-on-click"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "relaciones",
      "title": "Tipos de relación",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          <code>kind</code> acepta <code>association</code> (línea con flecha",
            "          abierta), <code>inheritance</code> (triángulo hueco en el destino),",
            "          <code>composition</code> (diamante relleno en el origen),",
            "          <code>aggregation</code> (diamante hueco en el origen),",
            "          <code>dependency</code> (línea punteada) y <code>realization</code>",
            "          (punteada con triángulo hueco).",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-class-diagram open-on-click>",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "              {",
            "                \"classDiagram\": {",
            "                  \"direction\": \"LR\",",
            "                  \"classes\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"A\", \"name\": \"A\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"B\", \"name\": \"B\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"C\", \"name\": \"C\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"D\", \"name\": \"D\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"E\", \"name\": \"E\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"F\", \"name\": \"F\" }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"relations\": [",
            "                    { \"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"B\", \"kind\": \"association\", \"label\": \"association\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"B\", \"to\": \"C\", \"kind\": \"inheritance\", \"label\": \"inheritance\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"D\", \"kind\": \"composition\", \"label\": \"composition\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"D\", \"to\": \"E\", \"kind\": \"aggregation\", \"label\": \"aggregation\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"E\", \"to\": \"F\", \"kind\": \"dependency\", \"label\": \"dependency\" }",
            "                  ]",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-class-diagram>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "compartimentos",
      "title": "Compartimentos",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          La caja crece con el número de atributos y métodos. Los",
            "          compartimentos vacíos (sin atributos, sin métodos) se omiten junto",
            "          con su línea divisoria.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-class-diagram open-on-click>",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "              {",
            "                \"classDiagram\": {",
            "                  \"direction\": \"LR\",",
            "                  \"classes\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"Vacia\", \"name\": \"SoloNombre\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"ConAttr\", \"name\": \"ConAtributos\", \"attributes\": [\"+a: string\", \"+b: number\"] },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"Completa\", \"name\": \"Completa\", \"stereotype\": \"<<value>>\",",
            "                      \"attributes\": [\"+a: string\", \"+b: number\", \"-c: boolean\"],",
            "                      \"methods\": [\"+hacer(): void\"] }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"relations\": [",
            "                    { \"from\": \"Vacia\", \"to\": \"ConAttr\", \"kind\": \"association\" },",
            "                    { \"from\": \"ConAttr\", \"to\": \"Completa\", \"kind\": \"association\" }",
            "                  ]",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-class-diagram>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "api",
      "title": "Referencia",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Atributos</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Nombre",
            "Valores",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>variant</code>",
              "<code>inline</code> · <code>viewer</code>",
              "inline abre el visor al hacer clic; viewer activa hover, tooltips, leyenda clickeable y auto-animación."
            ],
            [
              "<code>open-on-click</code>",
              "booleano",
              "Habilita abrir el visor a pantalla completa al hacer clic. Por defecto el componente no tiene visor."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Esquema del JSON</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Campo",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>direction</code>",
              "<code>TB</code> · <code>BT</code> · <code>LR</code> · <code>RL</code>."
            ],
            [
              "<code>classes[].id</code>",
              "Identificador que referencian las relaciones."
            ],
            [
              "<code>classes[].name</code>",
              "Nombre en el compartimento superior."
            ],
            [
              "<code>classes[].stereotype</code>",
              "Texto pequeño sobre el nombre, ej. <code>&lt;&lt;entity&gt;&gt;</code>."
            ],
            [
              "<code>classes[].attributes</code>",
              "Filas del compartimento de atributos."
            ],
            [
              "<code>classes[].methods</code>",
              "Filas del compartimento de métodos."
            ],
            [
              "<code>classes[].group</code>",
              "Id del grupo; define el color de la caja."
            ],
            [
              "<code>relations[].from</code> · <code>to</code>",
              "Ids de clase. Una relación a un id inexistente se descarta."
            ],
            [
              "<code>relations[].kind</code>",
              "<code>association</code> (default) · <code>inheritance</code> · <code>composition</code> · <code>aggregation</code> · <code>dependency</code> · <code>realization</code>."
            ],
            [
              "<code>relations[].label</code>",
              "Rótulo sobre la línea."
            ],
            [
              "<code>groups[].hue</code>",
              "Tono HSL 0–360."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Propiedades y eventos</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Nombre",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>payload</code>",
              "Configuración JSON; alternativa al script hijo."
            ],
            [
              "<code>layout</code>",
              "Geometría calculada (solo lectura)."
            ],
            [
              "<code>turtle</code>",
              "API de la animación: play / pause / stop / next / prev."
            ],
            [
              "<code>hiddenGroups</code>",
              "Set de grupos ocultos; al cambiar, el diagrama se re-diseña sin esas clases."
            ],
            [
              "<code>iswc-render</code>",
              "Evento: el SVG terminó de construirse."
            ],
            [
              "<code>iswc-turtle-state</code>",
              "Evento: estado de la animación."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "app-api",
      "title": "App API",
      "lede": "El mismo documento se abre en el visor o en el editor. El parámetro json no se reescribe al modificar el diagrama.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p><a href=\"demos/diagramas/app/view.html?kind=class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Abrir visor</a> · <a href=\"demos/diagramas/app/edit.html?kind=class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Abrir editor</a></p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ficha": {
